  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression = √((12345)² + 12345 + 12346)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n(a + 1)² = a² + 2a + 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (12345)² + 12345 + 12346\n\n⇒ (12345)² + 12345 + (12345 + 1)\n\n⇒ (12345)² + 2 × 12345 + 1\n\n⇒ (12345)² + 2 × 12345 + 1\n\n⇒ (12345 + 1)²\n\n⇒ (12346)²\n\n⇒ √((12346)²)\n\n⇒ 12346\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 12346.**",
